hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"203","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us, Amr bin Al-Harith told me, that Ibn Shihab told him, on the authority of Abbad bin Zaid On the authority of Urwa bin Al-Mughirah bin Shu’bah, he heard his father say: “I poured water on the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, when he performed ablution in The Battle of Tabuk, and he wiped over the socks.”"
